The NB Garden is next to the chapel of São Geraldo, a place where the healthy tradition of bringing people together to give life to the local patimonio is kept alive. A community united by its roots, where we can experience the taste for the land and cultivation combined with modernity united by its roots. NB Garden is your new getaway in Aveiro!!

Surrounded by a beautiful garden, it offers leisure places where you can practice sports activities, walk or cycle, being part of the culture and tradition of the region.

Apartments of various types:

T1

T1+1

T2

T2 Duplex

T3 Duplex

It consists of 4 floors with parking spaces in the basement, balconies and outdoor gardens. Very high quality finishes.

The construction quality of the project has the following characteristics:

- heat pump for water heating;

- BOSCH air conditioning;

- electronic security lock;

- Video intercom, at the access to the condominium;

- high standard of vertical and horizontal sound insulation between fractions;

- Built-in LED lighting, high efficiency;

- the bespoke carpentry part, with high quality wood and lacquer, doors with electromagnetic locks and wardrobes with linen interior;

- interior floors of all rooms of the apartments, with the exception of the sanitary facilities, in SPC CORKART vinyl, -

- balcony flooring and concrete slabs - Amop;

- lacquered kitchen furniture with high-quality fittings, equipped with a combined fridge, oven, microwave, ceramic hob, extractor fan, dishwasher and washer-dryer;

- wall-mounted washbasin and wall-hung toilet, shower tray, W2007 taps;

- ORONA lift;

- among other exquisite, luxurious and sophisticated details.

